    "title": "SudoMsg",
    "description": "`AuthSudoMsg` contains variants of messages that can be sent to the authenticator contract from smart account module through `CosmWasmAuthenticator`.\n\n`AuthenticateRequest` is `Box`-ed due to large size difference between other variants",
